WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.887
Know what is inside before you press play.

2
00:00:02.887 --> 00:00:06.581
Every video now has a description based on the
recording itself.

3
00:00:06.581 --> 00:00:09.940
Select Details to read the overview and see its
chapters.

4
00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:11.955
Choose a chapter to start there.

5
00:00:12.855 --> 00:00:16.598
Search the content, even when you do not know
the title.

6
00:00:16.598 --> 00:00:21.021
For example, ask how to connect the support
schedule to your Outlook calendar.

7
00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:24.084
The result includes the relevant words and a
timestamp.

8
00:00:24.084 --> 00:00:26.125
Select it to watch that moment.

9
00:00:27.025 --> 00:00:31.422
Below the player, Inside this video brings the
chapters and transcript together.

10
00:00:31.422 --> 00:00:36.552
Find a word to narrow the transcript, then
select a line to jump there.

11
00:00:36.552 --> 00:00:38.018
Captions are also available.

12
00:00:38.018 --> 00:00:40.583
Generated wording and timings can be
approximate.

13
00:00:41.483 --> 00:00:45.358
For films without speech, open Scenes to explore
what is shown.

14
00:00:45.358 --> 00:00:47.471
These visual descriptions are searchable too.

15
00:00:47.471 --> 00:00:50.994
Browse, read ahead, and go straight to the part
you

16
00:00:50.994 --> 00:00:53.107
need in the ANC video library.
